    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command CU (CV) - Verify a PIN & Generate a n ABA PVV (of a customer selected PIN)\n\n- **Command Code:** `CU`\n- **Response Code(s):** `CV`\n- **Manual Page:** 317\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nVerify a PIN , and if successful, generate the PVV of the customer selected PIN using the ABA PVV method. The Current & New PINs are supplied in an encrypted PIN Block.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `CU` |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `CV` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command CU (CV) - Verify a PIN & Generate a n ABA PVV (of a customer selected PIN)\n\n- **Command Code:** `CU`\n- **Response Code(s):** `CV`\n- **Manual Page:** 317\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nVerify a PIN , and if successful, generate the PVV of the customer selected PIN using the ABA PVV method. The Current & New PINs are supplied in an encrypted PIN Block.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `CU` |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `CV` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n"
    }
