    "source": "Thales payShield 10K Host Command Reference v2.3, Section 2.1, Command F2 (p. 676)",
    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command F2 (F3) - Verify a Terminal PIN using the VISA Method (AS2805 6.4)\n\n- **Command Code:** `F2`\n- **Response Code(s):** `F3`\n- **Manual Page:** 676\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo verify a PIN from a terminal using the VISA method.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `F2` |\n| 1 A + | 32 H |  The TPK under which the PIN block is encrypted; encrypted under LMK pair 14 - 15 variant 0 if the security setting \" Enforce key type 002 separation for PCI HSM compliance \" has the value \" N \" , or under LMK pair 36 - 37 variant 7 if the setting has the value \" Y \" . |\n| PVK pair | 32 H |  or |\n| 1 A + | 32 H |  or |\n| 1 A + | 48 H |  PVK encrypted under LMK pair 14 - 15 variant 0 |\n| STAN | 6 N | Systems Trace Audit Number |\n| Transaction Amount | 12 N | Transaction Amount |\n| PIN block | 16 H | The PIN block encrypted under the KPE |\n| PIN block format code | 2 N | One of the valid format codes. |\n| Account number | 12 N | The 12 right - most digits of the PAN ( excluding the check digit) . |\n| PVKI | 1 N | The PVKI (should be between 0 and 6). |\n| PVV | 4 N | The PIN Verification Value |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters . © Thales Group Page 677 of 819 |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `F3` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command F2 (F3) - Verify a Terminal PIN using the VISA Method (AS2805 6.4)\n\n- **Command Code:** `F2`\n- **Response Code(s):** `F3`\n- **Manual Page:** 676\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo verify a PIN from a terminal using the VISA method.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `F2` |\n| 1 A + | 32 H |  The TPK under which the PIN block is encrypted; encrypted under LMK pair 14 - 15 variant 0 if the security setting \" Enforce key type 002 separation for PCI HSM compliance \" has the value \" N \" , or under LMK pair 36 - 37 variant 7 if the setting has the value \" Y \" . |\n| PVK pair | 32 H |  or |\n| 1 A + | 32 H |  or |\n| 1 A + | 48 H |  PVK encrypted under LMK pair 14 - 15 variant 0 |\n| STAN | 6 N | Systems Trace Audit Number |\n| Transaction Amount | 12 N | Transaction Amount |\n| PIN block | 16 H | The PIN block encrypted under the KPE |\n| PIN block format code | 2 N | One of the valid format codes. |\n| Account number | 12 N | The 12 right - most digits of the PAN ( excluding the check digit) . |\n| PVKI | 1 N | The PVKI (should be between 0 and 6). |\n| PVV | 4 N | The PIN Verification Value |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters . © Thales Group Page 677 of 819 |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `F3` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n"
    }
