    "source": "Thales payShield 10K Host Command Reference v2.3, Section 2.1, Command JI (p. 527)",
    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command JI (JJ) - Reset Health Check Accumulated Counts\n\n- **Command Code:** `JI`\n- **Response Code(s):** `JJ`\n- **Manual Page:** 527\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo reset to zero the accumulated health check data counts. These counts are returned using the \" Get Health Check Accumulated Counts \" host commands.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `JI` |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `JJ` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command JI (JJ) - Reset Health Check Accumulated Counts\n\n- **Command Code:** `JI`\n- **Response Code(s):** `JJ`\n- **Manual Page:** 527\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo reset to zero the accumulated health check data counts. These counts are returned using the \" Get Health Check Accumulated Counts \" host commands.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `JI` |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `JJ` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n"
    }
