          "en": "Optional – Only present if Mode Flag = ' 11 ' . This flag selects a pre - specified Radix value, or alternatively, indicates that a user - specified value is to be used. ' A ' : F PE Radix Value = 10 ' U ' : User defined value specified in the next field Note: If this field is ' U ' , then the FPE Radix Value field must be present; otherwise, the FPE Radix Value field must be omitted. Note: The Message field must consist of values in the range 0… FPE Radix Value – 1."
