    "source": "Thales payShield 10K Host Command Reference v2.3, Section 2.1, Command P6 (p. 360)",
    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command P6 (P7) - Load OPINPad to HSM Memory\n\n- **Command Code:** `P6`\n- **Response Code(s):** `P7`\n- **Manual Page:** 360\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo store OPINPad into HSM memory using index GUID.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `P6` |\n| PAD ID | 32 H | The PAD Identifier . |\n| PAD Lifetime | 3 N | The lifetime of the PA G0 D in seconds . |\n| PIN Length | 2 N | The length of the PIN that the PAD can decode : Valid values from ' 0 4 ' up to ' 12 ' c haracters . Keys (substitution arrays) n A The Substitution keys ({PIN Length} x 10 x 2) |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `P7` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command P6 (P7) - Load OPINPad to HSM Memory\n\n- **Command Code:** `P6`\n- **Response Code(s):** `P7`\n- **Manual Page:** 360\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo store OPINPad into HSM memory using index GUID.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `P6` |\n| PAD ID | 32 H | The PAD Identifier . |\n| PAD Lifetime | 3 N | The lifetime of the PA G0 D in seconds . |\n| PIN Length | 2 N | The length of the PIN that the PAD can decode : Valid values from ' 0 4 ' up to ' 12 ' c haracters . Keys (substitution arrays) n A The Substitution keys ({PIN Length} x 10 x 2) |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `P7` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n"
    }
