      "es": "# Command RA (RB) - Cancel Authorized Activities\n\n- **Command Code:** `RA`\n- **Response Code(s):** `RB`\n- **Manual Page:** 503\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nCancel the Authorized state.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `RA` |\n| Mode flag | 2 H | Optional. If not present, all Authorised Activities are cancelled. If present, the following values are valid: ' 00 ' : Cancel all Authorised Activities ' 01 ' : Cancel the following Authorised Activities ' 02 ' ... ' FF ' : Reserved for future use Mode ' 00 ' No additional parameters are required Mode ' 01 ' Number of Authorised Activities 3 N The number of activities that follow. |\n| Authorised Activity | 1 n | A ASCII encoding of an authorized activity to cancel, in the format of: <category>[.<sub - category>][.<interface>][.<timeout>] |\n| Delimiter 1 | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . |\n| Authorised Activity | 2 n | A ASCII encoding of an authorised activity to cancel, in the format of: <category>[.<sub - category>][.<interface>][.<timeout>] |\n| Delimiter 2 | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . … … … |\n| Authorised Activity | N n | A ASCII encoding of an authorised activity to cancel, in the format of: <category>[.< sub - category>][.<interface>][.<timeout>] |\n| Delimiter N | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `RB` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command RA (RB) - Cancel Authorized Activities\n\n- **Command Code:** `RA`\n- **Response Code(s):** `RB`\n- **Manual Page:** 503\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nCancel the Authorized state.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `RA` |\n| Mode flag | 2 H | Optional. If not present, all Authorised Activities are cancelled. If present, the following values are valid: ' 00 ' : Cancel all Authorised Activities ' 01 ' : Cancel the following Authorised Activities ' 02 ' ... ' FF ' : Reserved for future use Mode ' 00 ' No additional parameters are required Mode ' 01 ' Number of Authorised Activities 3 N The number of activities that follow. |\n| Authorised Activity | 1 n | A ASCII encoding of an authorized activity to cancel, in the format of: <category>[.<sub - category>][.<interface>][.<timeout>] |\n| Delimiter 1 | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . |\n| Authorised Activity | 2 n | A ASCII encoding of an authorised activity to cancel, in the format of: <category>[.<sub - category>][.<interface>][.<timeout>] |\n| Delimiter 2 | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . … … … |\n| Authorised Activity | N n | A ASCII encoding of an authorised activity to cancel, in the format of: <category>[.< sub - category>][.<interface>][.<timeout>] |\n| Delimiter N | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `RB` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n"
