      "es": "# Command RS (RT) - Generate a Transaction Completion Response (when selected Transaction Key Scheme is Australian)\n\n- **Command Code:** `RS`\n- **Response Code(s):** `RT`\n- **Manual Page:** 721\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo generate a transaction Completion Response Message.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `RS` |\n| TK | 16 H |  or |\n| 1 A + | 32 H |  Single or double length Terminal Key, encrypted under LMK pair 14 - 15 variant 0 if the security setting \" Enforce key type 002 separation for PCI HSM compliance \" has the value \" N \" , or under LMK pair 36 - 37 variant 8 if the setting has the value \" Y \" . |\n| AB Field | 16 H | AB field, as defined in AS2805.6.2 |\n| MARZ | 8 H |  or 16 H Encrypted MAC Residue (Z) from the transaction completion confirmation request: 8 hex characters if TK is single length, encrypted under LMK 10 16 hex characters if TK is double length, encrypted under LMK pair 10 - 11 |\n| Message Length | 3 H | Length (in bytes) of the next field; max value X ' 320 |\n| Message Text | n B | Message text (maximum length = 800 bytes) |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Optional field; present only if MAC Length field is present; value = ' ; ' |\n| MAC Length | 1 N | Optional field; if field not present then value 0 is assumed: ' 0 ' : 32 - bit M AC (single or double length TK) ' 1 ' : 48 - bit MAC (double length TK only) ' 2 ' : 64 - bit MAC (double length TK only) |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `RT` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command RS (RT) - Generate a Transaction Completion Response (when selected Transaction Key Scheme is Australian)\n\n- **Command Code:** `RS`\n- **Response Code(s):** `RT`\n- **Manual Page:** 721\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v2.3\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTo generate a transaction Completion Response Message.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `RS` |\n| TK | 16 H |  or |\n| 1 A + | 32 H |  Single or double length Terminal Key, encrypted under LMK pair 14 - 15 variant 0 if the security setting \" Enforce key type 002 separation for PCI HSM compliance \" has the value \" N \" , or under LMK pair 36 - 37 variant 8 if the setting has the value \" Y \" . |\n| AB Field | 16 H | AB field, as defined in AS2805.6.2 |\n| MARZ | 8 H |  or 16 H Encrypted MAC Residue (Z) from the transaction completion confirmation request: 8 hex characters if TK is single length, encrypted under LMK 10 16 hex characters if TK is double length, encrypted under LMK pair 10 - 11 |\n| Message Length | 3 H | Length (in bytes) of the next field; max value X ' 320 |\n| Message Text | n B | Message text (maximum length = 800 bytes) |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Optional field; present only if MAC Length field is present; value = ' ; ' |\n| MAC Length | 1 N | Optional field; if field not present then value 0 is assumed: ' 0 ' : 32 - bit M AC (single or double length TK) ' 1 ' : 48 - bit MAC (double length TK only) ' 2 ' : 64 - bit MAC (double length TK only) |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `RT` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n"
