      "en": "# Command BW (BX) - Translate Keys from Old LMK to New LMK and Migrate to New Key Type\n\n- **Command Code:** `BW`\n- **Response Code(s):** `BX`\n- **Manual Page:** 94\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nThis command can be used to perform one of the following functions: ➢ Translate keys from encryption under an ' old ' LMK to encryption under a ' new ' LMK.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `BW` |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `BX` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n"
