      "es": "# Command EK (EL) - Load a Private Key\n\n- **Command Code:** `EK`\n- **Response Code(s):** `EL`\n- **Manual Page:** 195\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nLoad a n RSA or ECC private key (encrypted under the LMK) into the HSM ' s internal memory.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `EK` |\n| Key index | 2 N | ' 00 ... ' 20 ' : Index number for the Private Key to be stored (used if multiple storage of keys is required). |\n| Private Key length | 4 N | For a Variant LMK: Length (in bytes) of the next field. or 4 H For a Key Block LMK: This field is ignored; should be set to ' FFFF ' . Private Key The RSA Private Key to be loaded and stored inside the HSM. n B For a Variant LM K , the ' Private Key ' must be encrypted under LMK pair 34 - 35. or ' S ' + n B For a Key Block LMK, the ' Private Key ' must comply with the following: Key Usage Algorithm Mode of Use ' 03 ' , ' 04 ' , ' 05 ' , ' 06 ' ' R ' ' S ' , ' D ' , ' N ' '03' 'E' 'S', 'X', 'N |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `EL` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n",
