      "es": "# Command FW (FX) - Generate a n ABA PVV (of a customer selected PIN)\n\n- **Command Code:** `FW`\n- **Response Code(s):** `FX`\n- **Manual Page:** 276\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nGenerate a 4 - digit PVV using the ABA method . The PIN (for which a PVV is required) is supplied in an encrypted PIN Block.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `FW` |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `FX` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command FW (FX) - Generate a n ABA PVV (of a customer selected PIN)\n\n- **Command Code:** `FW`\n- **Response Code(s):** `FX`\n- **Manual Page:** 276\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nGenerate a 4 - digit PVV using the ABA method . The PIN (for which a PVV is required) is supplied in an encrypted PIN Block.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `FW` |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `FX` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n"
