    "source": "Thales payShield 10K Host Command Reference v1.9, Section 2.1, Response JD",
    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command JC (JD) - Translate a PIN from TPK to LMK Encryption\n\n- **Command Code:** `JC`\n- **Response Code(s):** `JD`\n- **Manual Page:** 340\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTranslate a PIN from encryption under a TPK to encryption under the LMK.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `JC` |\n| PIN B lock | 16 H |  or 32 H The source PIN block encrypted under the Source TPK. When using a DES Source TPK, this field will be 16 H. When using an AES Source TPK, this field will be 32 H. |\n| PIN Block F ormat C ode | 2 N | One of the valid PIN block format codes. For a 3DES Variant or 3DES Key Block LMK, the following field must be present: Primary Account Number (PAN) The PAN , used to form the PIN Block. 18 H If ' PIN Block Format Code ' = ' 04 ' : The 18 digit PAN excluding the check digit. If the PAN is less than 18 digits, it must be right - justified and padded with ' F ' s on the left. or 12 N For all other values of ' PIN Block Format Code ' : The 12 right - most digits of the PAN , excluding the check digit. For an AES Key Block LMK, the following two field s must be present: Primary Account Number (PAN) The PAN , used to form the PIN Block. n N The 12 - 19 digit PAN, in cluding the check digit. If present, the delimiter below must also be present. |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `JD` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command JC (JD) - Translate a PIN from TPK to LMK Encryption\n\n- **Command Code:** `JC`\n- **Response Code(s):** `JD`\n- **Manual Page:** 340\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nTranslate a PIN from encryption under a TPK to encryption under the LMK.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `JC` |\n| PIN B lock | 16 H |  or 32 H The source PIN block encrypted under the Source TPK. When using a DES Source TPK, this field will be 16 H. When using an AES Source TPK, this field will be 32 H. |\n| PIN Block F ormat C ode | 2 N | One of the valid PIN block format codes. For a 3DES Variant or 3DES Key Block LMK, the following field must be present: Primary Account Number (PAN) The PAN , used to form the PIN Block. 18 H If ' PIN Block Format Code ' = ' 04 ' : The 18 digit PAN excluding the check digit. If the PAN is less than 18 digits, it must be right - justified and padded with ' F ' s on the left. or 12 N For all other values of ' PIN Block Format Code ' : The 12 right - most digits of the PAN , excluding the check digit. For an AES Key Block LMK, the following two field s must be present: Primary Account Number (PAN) The PAN , used to form the PIN Block. n N The 12 - 19 digit PAN, in cluding the check digit. If present, the delimiter below must also be present. |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' ; ' . |\n| Delimiter | 1 A | Value ' % ' . Optional; if present, the following field must also be present . |\n| LMK Identifier | 2 N | LMK identifier; min value = ' 00 ' ; max value is defined by license; must be present if the above Delimiter is present. |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `JD` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n\n"
    }
