    "markdownDoc": {
      "es": "# Command LG (LH) - Set HSM Response Delay\n\n- **Command Code:** `LG`\n- **Response Code(s):** `LH`\n- **Manual Page:** 497\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nNo operation. This command is included only for backward compatibility with host applications developed against earlier Thales payment HSMs.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `LG` |\n| Value | 3 N | Value ' 000 ' to ' 255 ' . |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `LH` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n",
      "en": "# Command LG (LH) - Set HSM Response Delay\n\n- **Command Code:** `LG`\n- **Response Code(s):** `LH`\n- **Manual Page:** 497\n- **Firmware Version:** payShield 10K v1.9\n\n---\n\n### Function\n\nNo operation. This command is included only for backward compatibility with host applications developed against earlier Thales payment HSMs.\n\n### Command Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Command Code | 2 A | Value `LG` |\n| Value | 3 N | Value ' 000 ' to ' 255 ' . |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Must be present if a message trailer is present. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Optional. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n### Response Message\n\n| Field | Length & Type | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| Message Header | m A | Returned to Host unchanged |\n| Response Code | 2 A | Value `LH` |\n| Error Code | 2 A | `'00'` : No error, or standard two-digit error code |\n| End Message Delimiter | 1 C | Present only if present in the command message. Value X ' 19. |\n| Message Trailer | n A | Present only if present in the command message. Maximum length 32 characters. |\n\n"
    }
