          "en": "' A ' : for 1st mailer on a 2 - up form ' B ' : for 2nd mailer on a 2 - up form ' C ' : for a 1 - up form Primary Account Number (PAN) 12 N If a 3DES Key Block or Variant LMK is used: The 12 right - most digits of the PAN , excluding the check digit. or n N If an AES Key Block LMK is used: The full 12 - 19 digit PAN , including the check digit. If present, the delimiter below must also be present."
